  "description": "Custom Message Boxes for enhanced user interaction.\n      \n      The library includes various message boxes, such as:\n      - ConfirmBox\n      - ErrorBox\n      - InfoBox\n      - DebugErrorBox\n\t  - InputBox\n\t  - WaitForm\n\t  - ExceptionHandler\n      \n      Features:\n      - Copyable Error Messages: Easily copy error messages directly from the ErrorBox, streamlining the reporting process.\n      - Configurable Timeout: Set a timeout for the message boxes, allowing them to close automatically after a specified duration, improving user experience.\n      \n      Compatibility:\n      - .NET Framework 4.8.1\n      - .NET 8\n      - .NET 9",
